===persian===

شوقِ یک قطرهٔ باران به چمن،
شور یک بوسهٔ تو بر لبِ من،
مهربانی... ماه...
باران... و بهار...
و همین...
سالِ نو یعنی این...
۱۳۷۶/۱۲/۲۸

===machine===

The longing of one raindrop toward the grass,
the thrill of one kiss of yours on my lip,
kindness... the moon...
rain... and spring...
and just this...
The new year means this...
1376/12/28

===lantern===

The longing of one raindrop toward the grass,
the thrill of one kiss of yours on my lip,
kindness, the moon,
rain, and spring —
just this.
The new year means this.

1376/12/28

